      "rationale": "Directly operationalizes the query's target metric, giving the core axis for analysis. However, groundedness is compromised: many negative values (e.g. -4.29, -106.7) are not derivable from valid timestamps, and the row samples only show closed_at/sys_updated_on with no opened_at present, so computed values cannot be verified and negatives contradict a sensible reading."
